			<div class="content" id="post-content-3821213">
									

<p>Man, I dunno. This is really hard to swallow, for one. For example, I can't ingest stimulants and I don't suffer from sleep deprivation.</p>
<p>For two, it's another contest entry that's predicated on what comes after it and thus seems unfinished. It's this grand, sweeping, global effect and the Foundation's just like, &quot;Yeah, keep an eye on it and do stuff to counteract it if necessary, I guess.&quot; Like, form the description, this seems like it could be a 001, it's that pervasive. But by the end, I'm not sure how I feel about it, and I worry that the contest necessitating story-building is causing more articles to be written that do not and cannot stand on their own.</p>

