			<div class="content" id="post-content-3839406">
									

<p>There's something I'm finding just a little off about this and I can't quite put my finger on what. It might be that there's something missing that I'm just not picking up properly because it's meant to be part of a group of articles. I find the list of examples being side-effects from Foundation actions and their treatment of those side-effects (rather than the actual thing their original action was meant to deal with) a little odd too.</p>
<p>It's competently written and I definitely like the idea that the Foundation has put so much stuff out there that the world is actively hazardous to Foundation personnel, but the article just isn't clicking for me. No-vote.</p>

